ned the task 'Feet of Clay'.\n\n---\n\nTalk to Foreman Gronkin at the Cooling Chamber 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\nYou say, 'Hail, Foreman Gronkin'\nYour task 'Feet of Clay' has been updated.\nForeman Gronkin says 'Bah! What do you want! Can't you see I'm busy?! Been waitin' on some [clay], and it's late!'\nYou say, 'About the clay...'\nForeman Gronkin says 'What do you mean it's been delivered?! Them no good. . . They bypassed me again! You'll need to go down the way and check with each of the three foremen so see whether they got it. They are down the chamber a bit. One before you hit the pool south of here and the other in a southeast direction at the cooling chamber itself.'\n_This opens up the next three steps._\nTalk to Upper Foreman 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\n_Location: -675, -180, -111_\nYou say, 'Hail, Upper Foreman'\nUpper Foreman says 'I did receive the clay. Thanks. We were running low.'\nTalk to Middle Foreman 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\n_Location: -845, -975, -225_\nYou say, 'Hail, Middle Foreman'\nYour task 'Feet of Clay' has been updated.\nMiddle Foreman says 'Clay? You mean the clay that took forever getting' here?! Ya, I got it!'\nTalk to Lower Foreman 0/1 (The Cooling Chamber)\n_Location: -730, 60, -195_\nYou say, 'Hail, Lower Foreman'\nYour task 'Feet of Clay' has been updated.\nLower Foreman says 'I did get the clay finally! No thanks to you! Not like the clay's important or anything! Hmph!'\nTalk to the Gatekeeper in Brell's Rest 0/1 (Brell's Rest)\n_Head up either of the ramps towards Brell's Temple. The Gatekeeper stands at the temple's entrance._\nYou say, 'Hail, The Gatekeeper'\nYour task 'Feet of Clay' has been updated.\nThe Gatekeeper says 'Halt! State your [business]!'\nYou say, 'My business?!'\nThe Gatekeeper says 'You're not the regular delivery [guy]. . . Where's he?'\nYou say, 'I'm the new guy'\nThe Gatekeeper says 'You're checking on the clay? We got it, but not nearly enough! Tell [Trullica] that he better get a better handle on things or there will be severe consequences!'\nYou say, 'Why is this so important to Trullica?'\nThe Gatekeeper says 'He knows how important this clay is to Brell! He uses it in creating all living. . . What am I telling you this for? You may leave now!'\nTalk to Baslo Crackhammer in Underquarry 0/1 (The Underquarry)\n_If you enter the zone from Brell's Rest: Baslo is located in the first room east of the zone-in._\nYou say, 'Hail, Baslo Crackhammer'\nYour task 'Feet of Clay' has been updated.\nBaslo Crackhammer says 'Are you here about the [clay]?'\nYou say, 'Clay?'\nBaslo Crackhammer says 'One of the [workers] was is quite ill. We gave him some of the clay to make him feel better, but it just seemed to make him worse!'\nYou say, 'Workers?'\nBaslo Crackhammer says 'He's resting now and seems to be doing better. I don't know what you are doing to the clay, but it is definitely not working right!'\nReturn to Trullica 0/1 (The Foundation)\nYou say, 'Hail, Trullica'\nYour task 'Feet of Clay' has been updated.\nAll of the clay that Trullica was concerned about was delivered.\nTrullica says 'Something wrong with the clay?! I cannot believe this! I'll look into to it at once. Thank you for your help'\n_Reward:_\nExperience\n20 Brellium Tokens\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
